{"4029840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Warning: Burnt Out", "steam_appid": 4029840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Zero Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly horror game set in a dystopian future where firefighters are a private service. You play as Eddie, who along with teammate Kieren responds to a call of a missing boy in a burning train. When it is revealed the boy's family cannot pay, Eddie decides to head in alone against Kieren's wishes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot-the-Difference Anomaly Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look at the train car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything seems normal, follow the green arrows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything seems strange, follow the red arrows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the center of the train, and complete the rescue.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person psychological horror game inspired by <i>Shinkansen 0</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty settings, turn off <i>Deaths</i> or <i>Empty Anomalies.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cutscenes are skippable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 Anomalies To Encounter:</strong> anomalies are related to disaster horror, but can also be subtle or surreal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d41dc1d3bc905229c313b57697459c35.poster.avif?t=1779991305\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d41dc1d3bc905229c313b57697459c35.webm?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d41dc1d3bc905229c313b57697459c35.mp4?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Cutscenes:</strong> learn more about Eddie and Kieren, and the dystopian world they inhabit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/90c9546967ba9b6799d142966dff175e.poster.avif?t=1779991305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/90c9546967ba9b6799d142966dff175e.webm?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/90c9546967ba9b6799d142966dff175e.mp4?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Danger:</strong> watch out for dangerous anomalies as you try to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/3d7cb6a977e7de217fe60c290bc2f0cc.poster.avif?t=1779991305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/3d7cb6a977e7de217fe60c290bc2f0cc.webm?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/3d7cb6a977e7de217fe60c290bc2f0cc.mp4?t=1779991305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> the story has three unique endings depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world of Zero Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an anomaly horror game set in a dystopian future where firefighters are a private service. You play as Eddie, who along with teammate Kieren responds to a call of a missing boy in a burning train. When it is revealed the boy's family cannot pay, Eddie decides to head in alone against Kieren's wishes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spot-the-Difference Anomaly Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a good look at the train car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything seems normal, follow the green arrows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If anything seems strange, follow the red arrows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the center of the train, and complete the rescue.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person psychological horror game inspired by <i>Shinkansen 0</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomalies do not repeat until all have been seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty settings, turn off <i>Deaths</i> or <i>Empty Anomalies.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cutscenes are skippable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 Anomalies To Encounter:</strong> anomalies are related to disaster horror, but can also be subtle or surreal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029840/extras/d41dc1d3bc905229c313b57697459c35.poster.avif?t=1779991305\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta